# MVVM & Repository Pattern Rules

- Views (`src/screens/**/<Feature>Screen.tsx`):
  - Pure React component. No business logic or state mutations.
  - Must not import `apiClient` or `MMKV`.
  - Wrap in `observer` from `mobx-react-lite` if observing MobX stores.
- ViewModels (`src/screens/**/use<Feature>ViewModel.ts`):
  - Custom React hook managing component states, form validation, and calls to repositories.
  - No direct Axios or MMKV storage calls.
- Repositories (`packages/core/src/repositories/<Entity>Repository.ts`):
  - Single source of truth. Manages caching (`offlineCache`) and API fetches (`apiRequest`).
  - Sanitize API responses defensively with `?.` and `??`.
